{
  "name": "Sending Stone Pair",
  "type": "equipment",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "\n\n<p><strong>Activate <span class=\"pf2-icon\">3</span></strong> Envision, Interact, Command;</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per day per pair;</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> <span id=\"ctl00_RadDrawer1_Content_MainContent_DetailedOutput\">You send the other stone a mental message of 25 words or fewer, and it can respond immediately with its own message of 25 words or fewer.</span> If the stone is attended by another creature, they become the target of the sending spell.</p>\n"
